questions.explanation:
**Given:**

(3x - 4)&sup2;

**Formula Used:**

(a - b)&sup2; = a&sup2; - 2ab + b&sup2;

**Calculation:**

⇒ (3x - 4)&sup2; = (3x)&sup2; - 2 × (3x) × 4 + 4&sup2;

⇒ (3x - 4)&sup2; = 9x&sup2; - 24x + 16

**∴ The correct answer is 9x&sup2; - 24x + 16.**

